; Missing units at a per-unit price are the residual divided by the price,
; whether or not the price is in the units' own currency.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:B
2020-01-01 open Expenses:B

2020-01-03 * "units missing, price in the units currency"
  Expenses:B  2.50 USD
  Assets:A         USD @ 2 USD

2020-01-04 * "units missing, price in another currency"
  Expenses:B  2.50 USD
  Assets:A         EUR @ 2 USD

2020-01-05 balance Assets:A -1.25 USD
2020-01-05 balance Assets:A -1.25 EUR

2020-01-06 * "units missing at a cost in the units currency"
  Expenses:B  2.50 USD
  Assets:B         USD {2 USD}

2020-01-07 balance Assets:B -1.25 USD
